{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_05_end",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_05",
  "title": "拙山",
  "storyCode": "WR-5",
  "avgTag": "戦闘後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8214dc5c9771532e183e27e3fb418cb0f77e5b49f1df20a2d678c03283af098b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_140#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来るな！　来るなぁ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ててて、手がっ、俺の手がぁ！　……は、はは、どうして全く痛くないんだ？　俺は――"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガアッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ひいっ――来ないでっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "大丈夫か！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "遅いじゃない！！　どうして誰も鐘を叩かなかったの？　除夜の鐘を打つ僧侶はどこに行ったの！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あなたたちを信じて言う通りにしたのに、どうして！？　どうして私の夫は死んじゃったの！？　一体どうやって……どうやって償うつもりよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "……まずはここを離れるのが先決だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うわあぁ――お母さん、お母さん、お母さんを返してよぉ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガアッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "うおっ！　今回も危機一髪だったね！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "お、おじさん、お母さん、お母さんが――"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガアッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "小さいのを倒すだけならまだしも、外のデカいやつには歯が立たなさそうだ。お嬢ちゃん、しっかり捕まってろよ。ズラかるぞ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガァ――！　グァッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うわっ、もう一匹来た！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "き、キリがないな！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガア――ッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "グガッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "一体どっから湧き出てやがんだ……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "ダメだ。この数じゃ、全部は食い止めきれない――"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガッ……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "サガ",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#4",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "絵の中の人々とはいえ、これほどにひどい仕打ちを受けるなど……このような光景は、見ていて苦しくなる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "サガ",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#4",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "ラヴァ殿、ここは拙僧にお任せを。早く他の者を避難させるのだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "サガ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "サガ",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#4",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "心配はご無用。拙僧はこの地を遊歴すること数年、未来への憂いや迷いも多いが――"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "サガ",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#5",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "――目の前の危機を見過ごした事は一度もござらん！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "サガ",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#5",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "ここは、拙僧が守り抜く。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "……わかった。終わったら東に向かってくれ。そこでアタシたちと合流しよう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "サガ",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#5",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "承知つかまつった！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガアッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "サガ",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#6",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "拙僧ここにあり！　前に進むでない！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "サガ",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#6",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "この境界線を越えた者は――斬る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うあああーーん！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "お、お、お嬢ちゃん！　髪を引っ張るのはやめてくれないか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "お母さん――お母さん――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガアッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "ガァガァガァガァうるさいなぁ。こんなにしつこく追いかけ回す頭があるならば、人の言葉くらい話してみたまえ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……ニゲ……ルナ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "うおぉ、今のは冗談だって！　なっ、なんでも真に受けないでよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ううぅ、おじさん、前、前！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "へっ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "いやぁっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あ、あなたは占い師さん？　他の二人の英雄はどうしたんです？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "危ない、後ろ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガアッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "どうして化け物を連れてきたんです？　早く何とかしてください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "ええ？　私が！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "化け物を引き離してください、早く！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "い……いや私だってね――"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ううぅ、うわあぁ、お母さん、お母さん――"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "…………"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ああ、もう泣かないの！　ね？　泣かないでってば！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あっ！　化け物がこっちを見てる！　早く、早くどうにか――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガアアアッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "え……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "せ、扇子で？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "……ちょっと離れていてくれるかな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガアッ？　ガアッ――"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "]"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一発で……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガオッ！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "す、すごい……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "…………"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "のおおっ！　痛ててて、手が痺れた！　こいつら一体何なんだ？　見た目はフニャフニャなのに、叩くと結構カタいじゃないか！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "はぁ……そんな目で見ないでくれたまえ。曰く、「駄獣窮して人を噛む」とな。それより早く逃げよう！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガアッ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うーん。腕前はなかなかだけどぉ、ウユウくんはこういう状況で人助けをしたことがないんだねぇ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "目の前の敵だけ倒して、周りに気を配らなかったらぁ、いつか痛い目を見ちゃうかもよぉ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "あ、あはは……。恩人様のおかげで助かりましたよ。いや本当に危ないところでした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……はいは〜い。早く残りの人を連れて避難してねぇ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "え、恩人様は？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "私ぃ？　大丈夫だよぉ。私は足取りが軽いから、見つかりっこないと思うよぉ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "（足取りが軽いとかそんなレベルの隠れ身じゃないだろ！？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "さてとぉ……一気に敵の数を減らすにはぁ――"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "いやぁ！　あ、あの庭園の火はなに？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "サガ",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#3",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "おう！　火の柱が天に向かって伸びておる、なんと壮観な眺めか！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "サガ",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#3",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "む？　そうか。たしか「ラヴァ」というのは、異国の言葉で――"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "…………"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ラヴァちゃ〜ん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "……クルース、付近の敵の分布範囲を確認してくれ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "そんな大掛かりなのをやるつもりなのぉ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "ああ。周りの建物が心配で、みだりに派手なアーツは使わなかったんだが……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "敵が多すぎる。ちまちま対処してたら、計り知れない数の被害者が出るだろうから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "そうだねぇ。緊急事態には、緊急手段を――だよねぇ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "私は高いところに行くから、安心してやっていいよぉ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "アーツの範囲外にいる敵は私に任せてねぇ。一匹も取りこぼさないからぁ～。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "ああ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "任務報告はアタシが出そう……元々ロドスが助けるべき対象は、感染者だけにとどまらない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感染者……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "どうした？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ううん……なんでもないよぉ。あ、その前にねぇ、ラヴァちゃん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "煮傘さんは見かけたぁ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
